 marché libre\nTVA abaissée à 5,5 %\nÉligibilité au Prêt à Taux  Zéro (PTZ) pour les primo-accédants\nMeilleure capacité d’achat\n\n*Source Google Maps\n**Sous conditions de ressources et d’éligibilité","addr":"86 Rue de l'Etraz  ","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjhkNDk1MTAzOWJlOWYxYTFlNDc1OTRlMDdhNTg4NmM3MmQxYzliMWYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5MjZjN2I0NGEwZGFmZWNmZTRmNTZhNmI4NDdlZjgwNSJ9?signature=ee9db8ed95ba35fbf48fda55b5bdae7053b97b7e1c5e179ff55e39c7ee8843a7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQyYmVjZWFlODliYWE3MGIyMmU1ODU4ZWY2OWJiYWQ4YTliYmQyNmQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3MzMyM2I2MTdmYTlmNjVmNTQ5YzE0NWM3MzQ3ZTc5NCJ9?signature=00ef8099b1e80bbed255d5a3b1f9f066d63383b2e8b3eb75ea11d2ef1afb4824","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc5NGJkNDZkMWQwZjYyZTczNWI5ZWI1NDkzMjhmMGUwOTIxYjZjY2MiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5YjM4OGE1NzU3NjYzYjViMDNlNDZmNjdhNjU4N2FlNSJ9?signature=b4ca7420ef1fc73aa37ecf1d838e45476e29cf6d93c804f1310b59d5e24dc24e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM3NzlmNTQ2ZGViNjQ5Yzk4ODI4M2VjNzVjZDkwMWM1Y2Q5YzU2ZTYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkN2I0ZjFmOTdlMGIwOThjNDU1YWY1ZjUxYzQ4MWYzNyJ9?signature=2751722ce1e08d38dc0d89ad06da0a8cee887ebfd8589f9a3aabae90cb121f6a"],"yt":[],"vr":["https://kaufman-faverges.see-around.app/"],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NjAzZjgwMDM0MDM2IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo4NSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo4NSwiZml0IjoiY292ZXIifX0sImZpb